  "headBody": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Install - Example Docs</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Install the toolkit on macOS, Linux or Windows.\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/site.css\"></head>\n<body class=\"docs\">\n<nav class=\"sidebar-nav\" aria-label=\"Docs\"><ul><li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/guide/install\">Install</a></li><li><a href=\"/guide/config\">Configure</a></li></ul></nav>\n<div class=\"doc-container\"><div class=\"toc\"><h2>On this page</h2><ul><li><a href=\"#macos\">macOS</a></li><li><a href=\"#linux\">Linux</a></li></ul></div>\n<main class=\"doc-content\"><h1 id=\"install\">Install</h1>\n<p>The toolkit ships as a single static binary. Pick the method that fits your platform.</p>\n<h2 id=\"macos\">macOS</h2>\n<pre class=\"highlight\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">brew</span> install example-toolkit\nexample --version</code></pre>\n<p>If you use <code>MacPorts</code>, run <code>sudo port install example</code> instead.</p>\n<h2 id=\"linux\">Linux</h2>\n<table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>Distro</th><th>Command</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Debian</td><td><code>apt install example</code></td></tr>\n<tr><td>Fedora</td><td><code>dnf install example</code></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"admonition note\"><p class=\"admonition-title\">Note</p><p>Root is not required for the user install.</p></div>\n<h3 id=\"verify\">Verify the install</h3>\n<ol><li>Open a new shell.</li><li>Run <kbd>example doctor</kbd>.</li><li>Confirm all checks pass.</li></ol>\n<div class=\"pagination\"><a rel=\"prev\" href=\"/guide/intro\">Previous</a><a rel=\"next\" href=\"/guide/config\">Next</a></div>\n</main></div>\n<footer class=\"doc-footer\">Edit this page on GitHub</footer>\n</body></html>\n"
}
